# Local Claude Code configuration — not part of the deployed site.
.claude/

# Internal planning documents are deliberately NOT ignored. openspec/ is tracked on
# purpose: the proposals, designs and archived changes are the record of why this
# code looks the way it does, and that belongs in the repository.
#
# They are kept off the public site by router.php instead, which is the mechanism
# that actually works here — nixpacks runs `php -S -t .` from the repo root, so a
# .gitignore entry would only affect files that were never committed, and every one
# of these already is. See router.php and tests/router_test.sh.
